    "intro": "Deciding to study abroad is an exciting but daunting step, especially when it comes to sorting out the finances. Many students think about options like scholarships and student loans. In this guide, we’ll look closely at these choices, talking about their advantages and disadvantages. Studying in another country can be fantastic for your education and personal development. But let’s face it, it’s expensive. That’s where scholarships and loans come in handy. They both have their good and bad sides, which we’ll go over together. Scholarships",
