    "intro": "HOW TO FIND A RIGHT ACCOMODATION. Finding a right accommodation in abroad is not just piece of cake. You have to check every single detail before getting your perfect accommodation. Abroad could be very taxing and risky at the same time. But, if seen isn’t risk everywhere? Getting a perfect accommodation could be overwhelming but with right knowledge and research you won’t have a lot on your plate to deal with. Many people tend to delay the accommodation part while dealing with visa or admission process and because of this you end up facing difficulties to find a right accommodation.",
